sequenceDiagram
  actor U as Водитель
  participant R as Rental
  participant F as Fleet
  participant P as Payment
  participant B as Банк
  participant A as Access
  participant T as Телематика
  U->>R: POST /rentals + Idempotency-Key
  R->>R: JWT, допуск, UNIQUE userId, Saga + Outbox
  R-->>U: 202 rentalId, STARTING
  R-->>F: ReserveVehicle
  F->>F: Транзакция: исключительное выделение
  F-->>R: VehicleReserved
  R-->>P: HoldDeposit
  P->>P: Сохранить operationId
  P->>B: PUT /holds/{operationId}
  B-->>P: HELD + holdId
  P-->>R: DepositHeld
  R-->>A: GrantAccess
  A->>A: Сохранить сессию и operationId
  A->>T: PUT /access-sessions/{sessionId}
  T-->>A: GRANTED + effectiveAt
  A-->>R: AccessGranted
  R->>R: ACTIVE + startedAt, commit
  U->>R: GET /rentals/{rentalId}
  R-->>U: ACTIVE

